            "value": "ウィジェット"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write access to iCloud is needed. Choose the folder again with “Choose Scriptable folder”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloudへの書き込み許可が必要です。「Scriptableフォルダを選ぶ」から同期先を選び直してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You never enter passwords or cookies for any AI service. The key only works with your own Mac and is stored in the iPhone’s Keychain. Send the connection file by AirDrop and delete it after pairing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各AIのパスワードやCookieは入力しません。接続キーは自分のMac専用で、iPhoneのKeychainに保存します。接続ファイルはAirDropで渡し、登録後に削除してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your AI limits, at a glance.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使えるAIを、ひと目で。"
          }
